<title>JAPAN: BOJ refrains from 0020 GMT money market operation.</title>
<headline>BOJ refrains from 0020 GMT money market operation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) refrained from its regular money market operation at 9.20 a.m. (0020 GMT) on Tuesday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The money market had a projected surplus of a net 120 billion yen at the outset of trade, they said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
